OL,3,GYorkshire
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA settled
OL,6,Fstart to Monday night. Winds will
OL,7,Fgradually freshen overnight with cloud
OL,8,Fand heavy rain arriving after
OL,9,Fmidnight. Some very heavy rain
OL,10,Fpossible towards dawn. Minimum
OL,11,FTemperature 7C.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FWindy start to Tuesday with
OL,14,Fheavier morning rain clearing. Drier
OL,15,Fand brighter by mid-afternoon with
OL,16,Ffurther strong winds and a chance of
OL,17,Fgales. Very or exceptionally mild by
OL,18,Fthe afternoon. Maximum Temperature 16C.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
